        <headline>Small Craft Advisory issued September 25 at 1:46PM EDT until September 26 at 11:00AM EDT by NWS Jacksonville FL</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...North winds 15 to 25 kt with gusts up to 30 kt and seas
7 to 10 ft.

* WHERE...Northeast Florida coastal waters from Fernandina Beach
FL to Flagler Beach FL out to 20 NM.

* WHEN...Until 11 AM EDT Saturday.

* IMPACTS...Conditions will be hazardous to small craft.
</description>
        <instruction>Inexperienced mariners, especially those operating smaller
vessels, should avoid navigating in hazardous conditions.</instruction>
